  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence and Lessons from Latin America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To ensure that lessons learned in Latin America on good practice in development research and policy are accessible to the development communityPolicy makers, practitioners, researchers and policy thinkers in SSA/SA have gained knowledge about LA development experiences on economic, environmental, governance and social issuesTo improve policy and practice in sub-Saharan Africa on priority economic, environmental and governance issues by providing decision makers with evidence syntheses, and online and face-to-face learning, on lessons from Latin America tailored to the African context. This contributes to our MDGs by leading to at least 50 significant examples of tailored evidence being shared, debated and adapted for local use in policy and practice.</narrative>
  </description>
